@nelsonlongxiang/dsh-open-a2a-net README · Model tools at a glance：Ten tools. With `teamScopeInfo` on (the default), `a2a_teams`, `a2a_status` and `a2a_probe` answer from
this host's joined-team scope: `[this host]` rows plus peers serving a team this host's nodes declared.
`a2a_tasks` (this host's own dispatch ledger) stays unscoped.

